              "text_sha256": "f834eb17399f734189ca7f827ac04d83f4518e4df2692314f22a4d661546a0fa"
            },
            "name": "回末诗",
            "number": 17,
            "text": "**17｜回末诗** 无；“石在，字在”终局锁。\n\n"
          },
          {
            "citation": {
